// Every user-visible string of the device UI, in both languages: S(Name, "中文", "English").
// One list builds both the Str enum and the two tables, so they cannot get out of step.
// Rules (tested in firmware/tests/ui_model_test.cpp): the English text is ASCII only, the Chinese text uses only
// glyphs of the shipped font subset (firmware/fonts/btr_ui.chars.txt), and both use the same printf placeholders.

